{
  "slug": "lookout",
  "name": "Lookout",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "A Claude Code plugin that keeps your AI toolchain current. Before you start new work, Lookout catches you up on everything that changed — then helps you incorporate what matters.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill** and **2 commands**.\n\n- **Skills** (1): `lookout` (Core Lookout skill — checks official sources for changes since your last run, triages them, and walks you…)\n- **Commands** (2): `capture` (Quick-capture a signal to your Lookout backlog for review on your next /lookout run), `lookout` (Check for AI tooling changes since your last run and review them interactively)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install lookout@claude-community` from `apardawala/ai-navigator` (`lookout`).",
